  'program.peace.behind': 'Training Local Mediators',
  'program.peace.behindDesc': 'Our team trains community members to facilitate dialogues and resolve conflicts at the local level.',
  'program.peace.faq1.q': 'How do you ensure neutrality in community dialogues?',
  'program.peace.faq1.a': 'We work with trained local facilitators who are selected for their respect across communities. All dialogues follow agreed ground rules focused on listening and shared goals. We do not take sides in local disputes and focus on process, not outcomes.',
  'program.peace.faq2.q': 'What makes your peacebuilding approach different?',
